<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "togisuma.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家居間.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>―It was past 8 p.m.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The people of the settlement had set out into the surrounding mountains to search for <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I was in the living room, under the bright electric lights.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\サクラ\サクラ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Momoko-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, I'm sorry... for this happening so suddenly..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Sakura-san's</STYLE> neck still clearly bore the marks of strangling.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Only <STYLE ID="2">Sakura-san</STYLE> and I had been left here.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Kotaro-san</STYLE> had asked me to stay with <STYLE ID="2">Sakura-san</STYLE>.<PG>
I want to know what happened, but <STYLE ID="2">Sakura-san</STYLE> probably can't talk calmly right now.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Right now I need to look after <STYLE ID="2">Sakura-san's</STYLE> heart. After all, she was nearly killed by her <STYLE ID="1">daughter</STYLE>.<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> was... like that too..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Chigaya</STYLE>? If I remember right, <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan's</STYLE> older sister, <STYLE ID="2">Sakura-san's</STYLE> eldest daughter.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So this isn't the first time <STYLE ID="2">Sakura-san</STYLE> has been through this?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Come to think of it, I think <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE> said something like that at the secret base.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Why did </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Oh, I'm sorry. Please just rest for now."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Abyss～深淵に至る窓～.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">"No, this concerns you too, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Momoko-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">The Motoki-cho case, and the Megasawa City case..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Connected to both cases, she says, but...<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> became like that once too, long ago, but she recovered with a certain medicine. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">A certain medicine that exists only in this settlement."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A certain medicine? Does she mean Droga?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
From what I found out, it's supposed to be something that removes the limiter controlling muscle strength.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"What kind of medicine is it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"It's... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">a medicine made from the roots of a cherry tree that grows wild only around here."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Could that medicine be... Droga?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"............?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　Droga...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　No, here the medicine is called falsificaso."</STYLE><PG>
Huh? So it's something else...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Falsi-whatever. That's a real tongue-<STYLE ID="6" RUBY="か">twister</STYLE> of a name.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Doesn't <STYLE ID="2">Sakura-san</STYLE> know about Droga?<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"If you give that </STYLE><STYLE ID="7" RUBY="なんとか">falsificaso</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> stuff to </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, will she get better?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> did. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> seems to have looked into all sorts of things, and we were able to cure </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">It is simple enough that you can make it without any special knowledge..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地昼中.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\夏菜中学バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Papa</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> told me that too. If I ever suddenly want to kill </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mama</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, I should tell him right away. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">He said he'd help me."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So that was it. I finally understood what <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE> had said at the secret base.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Kotaro-san</STYLE> had known a way to save <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE>.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家居間.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\サクラ\サクラ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"But why now, of all times..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"According to </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, that kind of murderous intent arises only in girls who have had their first period."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"With the first period...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Now that I think of it, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> was acting a little strange earlier."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"But why didn't </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> tell </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> about that properly?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"It is a change of the body at a sensitive age, so perhaps, as her </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">father</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, he couldn't say it plainly. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">That's why </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> put it as </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">'If you ever want to kill </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mama</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, tell me right away,'</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> it seems. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">I had told her myself to tell me right away when her first period came..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"And that after her first period, she'd want to kill you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"No, I avoided that. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> is the way she is, so I thought that if I told her, she might go into hiding after her first period..."</STYLE><PG>
I see. <STYLE ID="2">Sakura-san's</STYLE> thinking and <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan's</STYLE> actions had matched.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE> had somehow learned what happened with her <STYLE ID="5">older sister</STYLE>, and learned that at a certain age she would be struck by that kind of murderous intent.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE> didn't know what would trigger it, so she must have drawn the line at 15.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"I'll be breaking my promise to </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, but... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">the truth is, earlier, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> told me. That she'll run away from home when she turns 15."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I see... </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> realized it on her own... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Perhaps someone in the settlement told </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Someone in the settlement...?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"What happened with </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, everyone in the settlement knows about it too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">So somewhere in their hearts, everyone must be on guard in case </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> goes mad. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">So someone might have, to </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, in a roundabout way..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"But couldn't she be treated in advance?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　Do you have to wait for the first period or something?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"That's right. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">What's more, it has no effect unless it is given after she has gone through that murderous intent. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">That murderous intent seems to arise in resonance with my danger sense. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">As you know, my danger sense only works under limited conditions, so once I confirmed her first period, I meant to make sure </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> couldn't move and treat her in the three-mat room."</STYLE><PG>
To sum up, first period = the condition for the murderous intent, and <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE> hadn't been told that.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Because, given <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan's</STYLE> personality, she might run away from home.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And she couldn't be treated until <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE> had been gripped by that murderous intent.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But―<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"But how is that connected to the Megasawa City case or the Motoki-cho case?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"The Megasawa City case... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">was a murder case that happened because of a human experiment. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">At the time, </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> was being bullied, and, suffering over it, </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Mifuyu-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> tried to kill the bullies. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">She came to me about it, but... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">I stopped her. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">She seemed to be short of money too, so, to help even a little, I limited myself to sending goods she could sell for money."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"But... right around that time, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> was in the same state as </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> just now. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> searched for a treatment and arrived at falsificaso. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">But he said it had to be tested, to see whether it would harm the human body..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Tested, meaning...?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"The treatment </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> found was written in old documents in this settlement. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">And falsificaso is also a substance used in rituals. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Giving something like that straight to our </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">own daughter</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> was not a decision we could make easily. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">So before giving it to </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, we needed someone to be a test subject for falsificaso."</STYLE><PG>
And so the drug went to <STYLE ID="9">Mifuyu Niimura</STYLE> in Megasawa City...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But from what she just said, what was sent wasn't Droga but falsificaso...<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"At first I volunteered to be the test subject, but </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> stopped me. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">He said nothing must happen to me, their mother. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Besides, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> said he had someone in mind who would be a test subject. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">I don't mean to defend myself, but I never imagined he would send it to </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Mifuyu-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"As a result, the Megasawa City case happened, but we learned there were no notable ill effects on the human body, so we gave it to </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">And with that, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> came back to her senses. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">But where she'd had odd eyes, one blue and one green, both her eyes turned blue, like mine."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Then with odd eyes like </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan's</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, after the first period you go mad like that, you mean..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yes. Because her eye color changed, everyone in the settlement found out too."</STYLE><PG>
Having odd eyes is what causes the fierce murderous intent toward <STYLE ID="2">Sakura-san</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Seen that way, it does hang together, more or less, but every causal link is unclear.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And to square what she just said with the Megasawa City case, both falsificaso and Droga would have had to be sent.<PG>
No, maybe I don't need to stick my nose in this far...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE> is given falsificaso and comes back to her senses, that's enough.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"But when </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> was researching the treatment, he apparently discovered a certain long-abandoned </STYLE><STYLE ID="10" RUBY="おきて">rule</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Long ago, back before there was even electricity, things like this happened on very rare occasions, it seems. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10" RUBY="おきて">The rule</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> said this, apparently: 'If a green-eyed child is born, kill it at once.' </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">'Otherwise, that child will one day destroy the settlement.'"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A green-eyed child destroys the settlement?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Destroying a settlement just for being green-eyed, that's absurd...<PG>
But at that moment, what had happened that afternoon rose in my mind.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "111" "グラフィック\背景\キオク\小熊.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The killing of the cub.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That was nothing more than eliminating a future threat, and I can understand it, more or less.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But if that same pattern fits the killing of green-eyed children―<PG>
So, following this line, should I take it that the <STYLE ID="11" RUBY="おきて">rule</STYLE> 'kill the green-eyed child' fell out of use over time, and <STYLE ID="4">Kotaro-san</STYLE> happened to rediscover that rule while researching the treatment?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If that tradition had still been firmly in place, then both <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="5">her sister</STYLE> would have been killed right after they were born.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Like that cub.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"That green-eyed child is cursed from birth. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">So, it seems, the killings that child commits were called by this name."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\sceneswitch2.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "111" "グラフィック\背景\キオク\小熊反転.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "200" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
